-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          Red apple, Rasberry, Cacao, Juicy\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7Q36MicNiclTfcCUkjP6ZaWC6TuSBFdG4b00oOkHd97wB6V2VlSqkrnIaCSyJ16FV2GkicZCPWzhfT7w/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" style=\"height: 840px;width: 578px;\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           关于 Fazenda Guariroba 棕榈树庄园\n          </span>\n</strong>\n</section>\n<hr style=\"border-style: solid;border-width: 1px 0 0;border-color: rgba(0,0,0,0.1);-webkit-transform-origin: 0 0;-webkit-transform: scale(1, 0.5);transform-origin: 0 0;transform: scale(1, 0.5);\"/>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7TYSibVOfDRbicMRo8QHasfia2JzibF9IAJkZArPVRvl2Uy0c2oHicbFfzSKYiaySSKPXbYejibWDvTdxQDg/640?wx_fmt=png\" style=\"text-align: center;\"/>\n<br/>\n</section>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">\n          图片来自cafeimports 棕榈树位于Sul de Minas\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          Guariroba位于南米纳斯的圣安东尼奥杜安帕鲁（翻译这个名字好痛苦呀）\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7TYQVOuBAwWw6PNkxee7TZ2XLhKFemT9icTePokZPzpZazibWIWHLp8VRO7SohibdxSNxv84QRMUXSTQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" style=\"white-space: normal;\"/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          早在19世纪，创始人João Ferreira Carneiro就已经在Santo Antônio do Amparo肥沃的土地上生产咖啡\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          ，它就是\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          今天的Fazenda Guariroba的前身，\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          对改良咖啡的痴迷和渴望也\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          代代相传下来。\n         </span>\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7TYQVOuBAwWw6PNkxee7TZ2D1cVrcVnObJ9JZ2BTYL2eppBxAw6j21IFUtbefUmDWxSNHYian9NCWg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" style=\"text-align: center;white-space: normal;\"/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;text-align: center;\">\n<span style='font-size: 12px;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 1px;text-align: left;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>\n          庄园第五代 - Homero Aguiar Paiva\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          霍梅罗\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          Homero Agui\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          ar Paiva，一位土木工程师和家族的第五代传人，在2009年从他的叔叔Fernando Paiva那里获得了历史悠久的百年庄园Fazenda Cachoeira的一部分，继续种植咖啡。\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          在他的兄弟雷纳托·派瓦(Renato Paiva)的指导下，霍梅罗选择了较好的品种开始种植，并将这片土地命名为棕榈树庄园(Guariroba Farm)，以纪念他的外祖父母。\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          从那时起，追求卓越和保存最纯净的传统成为该农场的口号，\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          优越的风土条件和家族的丰富知识使Homero Paiva在专业咖啡生产方面取得了卓越的成就，其中就包括2016年巴西卓越杯竞赛的日晒组第一名\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          获得奖项\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          2016 巴西CoE #1（日晒组别）\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           关于Catucai-Catuai-Icatu\n          </span>\n</strong>\n</section>\n<hr style=\"border-style: solid;border-width: 1px 0 0;border-color: rgba(0,0,0,0.1);-webkit-transform-origin: 0 0;-webkit-transform: scale(1, 0.5);transform-origin: 0 0;transform: scale(1, 0.5);\"/>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          Catucai\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          是由\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          Catuai与Icatu选育而\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          来\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          ，\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          也有红色和黄色两个品种。\n         </span>\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           Catuai - 卡杜艾，在当地Tupi部族语言里是“very good”的意思，它是\n          </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           红色卡杜拉Caturra（代号IAC 476-11）与新世界Mundo Novo (代号374-19）于1949年在巴\n          </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           西圣保罗的科研中心IAC，人工将其杂交选育出来的，1972年开始在巴西商业种植推广。\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          Icatu 是来自于罗布斯塔和波旁杂交，然后再与新世界Mundo Novo杂交选育而来，有较好的抗叶锈病特性，高产量和较好的杯品。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;text-align: left;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style='font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 1px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);font-size: 14px;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n</span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<p>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;text-align: center;\">\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;text-align: center;\">\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;text-align: left;\">\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           处理过程\n          </span>\n</strong>\n</p>\n<hr style=\"border-style: solid;border-width: 1px 0 0;border-color: rgba(0,0,0,0.1);-webkit-transform-origin: 0 0;-webkit-transform: scale(1, 0.5);transform-origin: 0 0;transform: scale(1, 0.5);\"/>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;text-align: left;\">\n<strong style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          鲜果浮选（机械浮选）\n         </strong>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;text-align: left;\">\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7TYQVOuBAwWw6PNkxee7TZ2zjcdUJmACx2Zgm4L9JsfUMMNZWPfIcQVnhAUykk2FkBlrKKhlvVprg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" style=\"white-space: normal;\"/>\n</span>\n</strong>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;text-align: left;\">\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           晒干表面水份后装袋\n          </span>\n</strong>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7TYQVOuBAwWw6PNkxee7TZ2HWyK3GRicqDPFHzGDDjLiahfFt9icIL21rslXWJWVOYpCcXzNMyVy3BLw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" style=\"width: 578px;height: 545px;\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;text-align: left;\">\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           发酵到预定的程度后出袋晾晒（颜色和气味来综合判断发酵度）\n          </span>\n</strong>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7TYQVOuBAwWw6PNkxee7TZ2jhO7krEJe1LppkayniagXj8uA9PiasWqFT705xiatb2BicTicpfaq6Qak8w/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" style=\"width: 578px;height: 529px;\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7TYQVOuBAwWw6PNkxee7TZ2tsXhUPPPbTiaaklxP5Byac4vAiciagvRcYkcVVWt2V6GpsZ1nP2OmWfIA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" style=\"width: 578px;height: 479px;\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;text-align: center;\">\n<br/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;text-align: left;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n         晒到快接近预定干燥程度时收储静置\n        </section>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7TYQVOuBAwWw6PNkxee7TZ2YmB5icODJtBmMqsSdGy3R1DwI9WF2TZjjoFbjhDhUfjN6xBY0Vg2cCA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;text-align: left;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style='font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 1px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>\n          脱壳后静待出口\n         </span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7TYQVOuBAwWw6PNkxee7TZ2icibBQqNT5Nuq3gLGlVgKXnrwPUOibqJTh8S8OAyetQvrMYIeo766TYIw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" style=\"width: 578px;height: 749px;\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;text-align: left;\">\n<br/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;text-align: left;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style='font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 1px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);font-size: 14px;'>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.543999969959259px;text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          更多咖啡豆，欢迎关注小程序或者淘宝店铺 “有容乃大”\n          <br style=\"max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\"/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7Q09FO8svc4MbsT6kYe0icjVt0iafAKEvQb4V0sg5ELeaSJuChicNO6jr9zxGVFVu7wDwt3ibVQgXa5ow/640?wx_fmt=png\" style=\"height: 173px;width: 408px;\"/>\n</section>\n<p>\n<br/>\n</p>\n</div>",
